    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ekicweka ky'abantu ekyakomerwe kwimukya ekisiika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma Eryasibbu nyakatagara omukuru, akaimuka hamu na bagenzi be baanyakatagara, baayombeka irembo ly'entaama. Baalyeza, baalitamu enyigi; bakalyeereza kimu okugarukira ha munaara Hananeeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaakurasireho ogu, nubo abasaija ba Yeriko, nabo baayombeka, ayakurasire abo, nuwe Zakuru mutabani wa Imuli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi batabani ba Hasena, bakombeka irembo ly'encu; baalitamu emirabba n'enyigi, baalitamu ebyooma eby'okukingisa enyigi, n'ebihongozo byalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakurasire abo, nuwe Meremoosi mutabani wa Uliya, mwijukuru wa Hakozi, na uwe yayombeka. Ayakurasire abo, nuwe Mesulaamu mutabani wa Berekiya, mwijukuru wa Mesezabbeeri, na uwe yayombeka. Ayakurasire abo nuwe Zadooki mutabani wa Baana, na uwe yayombeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaakurasire abo, nubo Abaatekowa, nabo baayombeka; baitu abanyoro baabo bateekambire omulimo gwa Mukama wabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Yohiyada mutabani wa Paseya, na Mesulaamu mutabani wa Besodeya, bbo bakombeka irembo erikuru; baalitamu emirabba n'enyigi, ebyooma eby'okukinga enyigi, n'ebihongozo byalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaakurasire abo, ni Meratiya Omugibyoni, na Yadoni Omumeromoosi, abasaija aba Gibbyoni na Mizipa abaalemwaga omulemi omukuru ow'ensi ey'obuseeri bw'ekisaaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abakurasire abo, Uzyeri mutabani wa Haruhaaya, omuheesi wa zaabbu, nabo baayombeka. Ogu yakuratwa Hananiya, omu ha bakozi b'ebintu ebirukuboya, na uwe yayombeka; Yerusaalemu baarwimukya okuhika ha kisiika ekikooto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayakurasire abo, ni Rrefaaya mutabani wa Huura, omulemi ow'ekicweka ky'ensi eya Yerusaalemu, ogu na uwe akombeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo baakuratwa Yedaaya mutabani wa Harumaafu, uwe akombeka ekicweka ekikaba kiroleriire enju ye; ogu yakuratwa Hatusi, mutabani wa Hasabuneya, na uwe yayombeka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malikiya mutabani wa Halimu, na Hasubbu mutabani wa Pahasimowabbu bakasemeza ekicweka ekindi n'omunaara ogw'ebyooto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu akakuratwa Salumu mutabani wa Haloheesi, omulemi ow'ekicweka kya Yerusaalemu, ogu na uwe akombeka, hamu na bahara be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuuni, n'abantu enzaarwa eza Zanowa, abo bakombeka irembo ery'ekihanga; bakalyombeka, baalitamu enyigi, ebyoma bya ifo eby'okulikinga, n'ebihongozo byalyo, kandi baayombeka emikono rukumi ey'ekisiika eki, okugarukira ha irembo ery'obusa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malikiya mutabani wa Rrekabbu, omulemi ow'ensi ya Bbesihakeremu, nuwe yayombekere irembo ery'obusa; akalyombeka yalitamu enyigi zaalyo n'ebyoma byalyo eby'okulikinga; n'ebihongozo byalyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Salumu mutabani wa Koruhoze, omulemi ow'ensi Mizipa, ogu akombeka Irembo ery'ensoro; akalyombeka yalisweka, yalitamu enyigi zalyo n'ebyooma byalyo eby'okulikinga, n'ebihongozo byalyo; kandi akombeka n'ekisiika eky'ekiyanja ekya Seera eky'omusiri gw'omukama, okuhika ha matembero aganyakuruga omu rubuga rwa Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, haakurataho Nehemiya mutabani w'Azibbuki, omulemi ow'ekicweka ky'ensi Bbesi-zura, ogu akombeka ekiikaro ekinyakuroleriire egasani ya Daudi, okuhika ha kiyanja ekyalimirwe abantu, okugarukira ha nju ey'abasaija ab'amaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, haayombeka Abaleevi, nubo banu: Rehumu mutabani wa Bbani; ogu yakuratwa Hasabbiya, omulemi ow'ekicweka eky'ensi Keira, ogu akombeka habw'ensi ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, abaanyina baayombeka, nubo banu: Baviya mutabani wa Henadadi omulemi w'ekicweka ky'ensi eya Keyira; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogu yakuratwa Ezeri mutabani wa Yeswa omulemi wa Mizipa, nawe yayombeka ekicweka ekindi ekinyakuroleriire ha matemba, noogenda Sitoowa enyakwahurwamu ebyokurwana, enyakuli ha bwekubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, Bbaruki mutabani wa Zebbai, na uwe yayombeka ekicweka ekindi, okuruga ha bwekubo, okuhika ha rwigi rw'enju ey'Eryasibbu nyakatagara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, haayombeka Meremoosi mutabani wa Uliya mwijukuru wa Hakozi, akombeka ekicweka ekindi, okuruga ha rwigi orw'enju ey'Eryasibu, okuhika h'erukugarukira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, haayombeka banyakatagara, abantu ab'omu kyeya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo obu baamazire haayombeka Benyamiini na Hasubbu, baayombeka ekicweka ekirukukurataho, ekikaba kiroleriire enju yabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, haayombeka Binuyi mutabani wa Henadadi, yayombeka ekicweka ekindi, okuruga ha nju y'Azaliya, okuhika ha bwekubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Parali mutabani wa Uzai, uwe akombeka ekicweka ekirukukurataho, yatandikira ha kasonda k'ekisiika na ha munaara, ogw'ekikaali eky'eruguru, haihi n'ezigati ey'abalinzi. Ogu obu yamazire, haayombeka Padaya mutabani wa Parosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi abaheereza ab'enju ya Ruhanga, abaaraaraga omu rubuga Oferi, bakombeka okuhika ha kiikaro ekinyakuroleriire omulyango ogw'amaizi, ha bukiizi obw'emoso n'omunaara ogunyakulinda Enju ya Ruhanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, Abatekowa, bakombeka ekicweka ekindi ekinyakuroleriire Omunaara, okugarukira ha kisiika eky'Oferi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
