          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eruguru y'irembo ery'embaraasi, nuho haayombekere baanyakatagara, buli omu naayombeka aroleriire enju ye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo obu bamazire, Zadooki mutabani wa Imeri yayombeka, na uwe aroleriire enju ye. Ogu obu yamazire, hayombeka Sekaniya omulinzi ow'irembo erya Burugaizooba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, Hananiya mutabani wa Selamiya, na Hanuni omwojo owa mukaaga owa Zalafu, yayombeka ekicweka ekindi. Ogu obu yamazire, haayombeka Mesuraamu mutabani wa Berekiya, yayombeka aroleriire ekisiika kye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ogu obu yamazire, omu ha baheesi ab'ezaabbu, yayombeka okugarukira ha nju y'abalinzi ab'Enju ya Ruhanga n'ey'abasuubuzi, oroleriire irembo nambere abantu basorrokaniire, n'okuhika ha kisiika eky'eruguru ekya ha nsonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 3:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi hagati y'ekisiika eky'eruguru eky'omu nsonda n'irembo ery'entaama, abaheesi ab'ezaabbu n'abasuubuzi, nubo baayombekereyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.3.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.3.32"
            ]
          }
        }
